*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

coverage
demo-public
tmp-*

# `test/benchmark.js` downloads the published llm-splitter here on first run.
test/.cache

# Claude Code: ignore personal/local files, track the shared workflow. The
# OpenSpec commands and skills are regenerable via `openspec update`, but
# committed so contributors get `/opsx:*` without re-running init; `type-probe`
# is ours and is not regenerable. Anything added under here needs its own
# negation or it is silently dropped from the commit.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
.claude/commands/*
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/commands/opsx/
!.claude/skills/openspec-*/
!.claude/skills/type-probe/
